      "side": 1,
      "message": "Now that it\u0027s no longer static you no longer have a synchronization problem here. Why did you make the maps static originally though ? If you want to make them static you could use the on-demand initialization holder pattern or something https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Initialization-on-demand_holder_idiom\n\nLikely, what you have now is better though.",
