      "writtenOn": "2023-08-30T08:48:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It was static because:\n1. Not sure if it is ok if we have multiple instances to access the same BpfMap.\nPer offline discussion with motomu@, we are already doing this, where CookieTagMap is opened from three places. \n\n2. Not sure about the initializaion overhead.\nPer offline discussion with motomu@, the map fd is cached.\nhttps://source.corp.google.com/h/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:frameworks/libs/net/common/device/com/android/net/module/util/BpfMap.java;l\u003d70?q\u003dBpfMap.java\u0026ss\u003dh%2Fandroid%2Fplatform%2Fsuperproject%2Fmain%2F%2B%2Fmain\nSo we are actually accessing the same map, there should be no need to be static here.",
      "parentUuid": "9d5c5503_826905cb",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 61,
        "startChar": 8,
