      "writtenOn": "2023-08-30T08:56:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "bpf map read and write are atomic operations.  \nWriter has the consecutive operation of bpf read, update value, and bpf write.  \nThis operation is guarded by synchronization between writers.\n\nBut writer does not write the incomplete value to the bpf map.  \nSo, I don\u0027t think we need synchronization between reader and writer.",
